span>4</span><small>System</small></div><div class=\"\"><span>5</span><small>E-Mail</small></div><div class=\"\"><span>6</span><small>Abschluss</small></div></nav><main><h1>Willkommen bei Qisutu</h1>\n        <div class=\"qisutu-install-welcome\">\n            <div>\n                <h2>Willkommen bei Qisutu</h2>\n                <p>Dieser Assistent richtet das Qisutu Ticketsystem, die Datenbank, den ersten Administrator und die wichtigsten Systemeinstellungen ein.</p>\n                <p>Die Installation führt dich Schritt für Schritt durch alle erforderlichen Angaben und prüft die wichtigsten Voraussetzungen automatisch.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"qisutu-install-company\">\n                <strong>Franziska Steps</strong><br>\n                Qisutu - Kim-KI<br>\n                82 Chemin des Launes<br>\n                06510 Carros<br>\n                France<br><br>\n                +33 6 98 21 25 38<br>\n                <a href=\"mailto:support@qisutu.de\">support@qisutu.de</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Instanz</h3>\n        <div class=\"qisutu-install-credentials\">\n            <div><span>Instanzkennung</span><strong>qisutu</strong></div>\n            <div><span>Webpfad</span><strong>/qisutu</strong></div>\n            <div><span>Datenbankname</span><strong>qisutu</strong></div>\n            <div><span>Datenbankbenutzer</span><strong>qisutu</strong></div>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Systemprüfung</h3>\n        <div class=\"qisutu-install-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Prüfung</th><th>Ergebnis</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Perl</td><td>Version 5.034</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul DBI</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul DBD::mysql</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul IO::Socket::SSL</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul Authen::SASL</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul MIME::Base64</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul MIME::QuotedPrint</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul Net::SMTP</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Perl-Modul Net::LDAP</td><td>vorhanden</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>MariaDB/MySQL Client</td><td>mariadb</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Apache CGI</td><td>CGI/1.1</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Datenbankschema</td><td>lesbar</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Datenbank-Grunddaten</td><td>lesbar</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>QisutuConfig.pm</td><td>beschreibbar</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>Installationsverzeichnis</td><td>beschreibbar</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr><tr><td>SHA-512 Passwort-Hash</td><td>verfügbar</td><td><span class=\"qisutu-install-status ok\">OK</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n        <form method=\"post\" action=\"install.pl\">\nEXIT=0"}],"is_error":false,"command":"curl -s -i http://localhost/qisutu/install.pl | head -40; echo \"EXIT=$?\"","exit_code":0,"timeout":false,"metadata":{"exit_code":0,"pid":-1,"working_dir":"/workspace","prefix":"","suffix":""},"kind":"TerminalObservation"},"action_id":"efa86701-f137-4e97-8317-eae214026fd3","extended_content":[],"kind":"ObservationEvent"}